{
  "_comment": [
    "Composite indexes required by server-side paged queries (server/dao/FirestoreAttemptDao.ts).",
    "Firestore can serve a single equality filter with an orderBy using its automatic single-field",
    "indexes, but any filter+orderBy combination beyond that needs an explicit composite index — and",
    "without one Firestore FAILS the query rather than answering it slowly.",
    "",
    "The DAO falls back to a capped in-memory page when a query fails, so a missing index degrades",
    "performance instead of breaking a dashboard. Deploy these to get the fast path:",
    "  firebase deploy --only firestore:indexes",
    "Building them takes a few minutes on a large collection, so do it before an exam window, not",
    "during one. `firebase firestore:indexes` prints the current state.",
    "",
    "Combinations below mirror exactly what AttemptController passes: a school caller is always",
    "scoped to schoolId and a student caller to studentId, with examId and status as optional",
    "filters, ordered by startTime, score or endTime descending."
  ],
  "indexes": [
    {
      "collectionGroup": "attempts",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "examId", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "startTime", "order": "DESCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collectionGroup": "attempts",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "examId", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "score", "order": "DESCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collectionGroup": "attempts",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "examId", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "endTime", "order": "DESCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collectionGroup": "attempts",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "schoolId", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "startTime", "order": "DESCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collectionGroup": "attempts",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "schoolId", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "score", "order": "DESCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collectionGroup": "attempts",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
